  "title": "2026-09-08-comp-134600 · chat-assistant-rollout",
  "description": "# Support assistant · memory & staged rollout\n\nRead the teal live-turn region left to right: web/mobile input is screened, then profile facts, conversation history and retrieved help-center articles assemble the model context. Optional billing/account actions fetch vault credentials per invocation without retaining them. Output screening permits a reply or substitutes a safe fallback. The human-handoff callout specifies escalation triggers and the transcript, profile and attempted-action package.\n\nBelow left, completed transcripts are distilled into durable profile facts; conflicts supersede older facts with source-conversation provenance. Retention expiry moves raw history to compliance-recoverable cold storage, never live retrieval.\n\nBelow right, versioned prompt/retrieval/model configurations split traffic between champion and a small challenger sample. Completed conversations feed automated judges and a per-challenger report. Product-owner approval switches champion configuration while retaining the previous champion; rejection keeps the champion.\n\nThe bottom region independently monitors resolution, handoffs and safety triggers per variant. Any challenger regression immediately disables its traffic. A separate one-step rollback restores the retained champion configuration. Rollout is configuration-driven, not a service redeploy.",
  "mode": "diagram",
